  "details": "ClientSim gathers the \"PlayerPersistenceObjects\" in ClientSimPlayer.cs before ClientSim removes objects that are tagged EditorOnly. This breaks the ClientSim initialization process, resulting in \"_stackedCameraReady\" never being set to true. This results in the menu's \"ToggleMenu\" function failing to close the menu, causing the user being unable to test their scene under this scenario.",
